Article 10 (Allowances and Travel Expenses, etc.) Within budgetary limits, the Committee may pay allowances, travel expenses, and other necessary expenses to the following persons: Provided, That this shall not apply to public officials attending Committee meetings in direct connection with their official duties:
1. Members of the advisory committee under Article 4;
2. Relevant experts or employees of relevant agencies or organizations providing advice or conducting investigations or research under Article 9;
3. Experts attending Committee meetings.
